# **`09_dict_map.lc` (Key-Value Dictionaries & Hash Tables)**
# **Purpose**: Easy-to-use key-value lookup structures without manually composing pairs.
# **Contents**:
# Association lists (`assoc_list`) and functional Trie / Radix tree dictionaries.
# `dict_empty`, `dict_insert`, `dict_get`, `dict_remove`, `dict_keys`, `dict_values`.
# `dict_merge` for combining environment dictionaries.

